    "name_raw": "Disrupting Shot",
    "definition_type_raw": "Combat",
    "source_book_raw": null,
    "definition_raw": "With a well-placed shot, you make it harder for a nearby opponent to cast spells.\n\nPrerequisites: Dex 13, Point-Blank Shot, fighter level 6th.\n\nBenefit: If you ready an action to shoot an opponent casting a spell within 30 feet and successfully hit that opponent with a ranged attack, the concentration DC to successfully cast the spell is increased by +4.",
